@ 2:6  a,b,1|0
  2:5-2:7 "10"
  | **value** 10
@ 3:6  a,c,1|;2
  3:5-3:8 "1;2"
  | **value** 1
  |
  | Only the number at the start of the value "1;2" is read (1): the text ";2" after it is ignored.
@ 4:6  a,d,a|bc
  4:5-4:8 "abc"
  | **value** NaN
  |
  | `abc` is not a number, so the link counts as 0.
@ 5:6  a,e,-|1
  5:5-5:7 "-1"
  | **value** -1
  |
  | `-1` is negative, so the link counts as 0.
@ 6:6  a,f,"|7"
  6:5-6:8 "\"7\""
  | **value** 7
